BEC & POWER REMINDERS
1. REMOVE THE ESC'S MIDDLE RED 5V WIRE AT S1: Your 50A ESC has a built-in 5V/3A BEC,
   and the CoreWing F405 Wing MINI V2 has its own onboard BECs. Pull the red wire out
   of the ESC's 3-pin servo plug and insulate it with heatshrink so only Signal and
   Ground connect to S1—otherwise the two 5V regulators will fight and fry the board.
2. SET VTX BEC JUMPER TO 9V: A 3S battery sags to ~10.2V under full throttle; 9V
   regulated keeps the Rush Max SOLO 2.5W steady without brownouts.
3. SET SERVO BEC JUMPER TO 5V (or 6V only if your 3 servos are rated for 6V).
4. NEVER POWER THE 2.5W VTX WITHOUT THE ANTENNA ATTACHED: Leave VTX in PIT/25mW on
   the bench and ensure cooling airflow over the top fan/heatsink.
5. UNLOCK US-VERSION VTX: Hold both buttons on the Rush Max SOLO for 3-5 seconds
   (or load the unlocked SmartAudio 2.1 VTX table in INAV) to unlock 48CH / 2.5W.


INAV CLI CONFIGURATION (CANARD + ELEVONS + AUTOLAUNCH)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Note: Verify the VTX SmartAudio TX pad on the F405 Wing MINI pinout card
# (serial 0 = UART1 / TX1; change to serial 2 = UART3 / TX3 if wired to TX3).

# --- 1. SERIAL PORTS (UART1=SmartAudio, UART2=ELRS RX, UART6=GPS) ---
serial 0 2048 115200 115200 0 115200
serial 1 64 115200 115200 0 115200
serial 5 2 115200 115200 0 115200


# --- 2. RECEIVER, GPS & COMPASS ---
set receiver_type = SERIAL
set serialrx_provider = CRSF
feature GPS
set gps_provider = UBLOX
set gps_sbas_mode = AUTO
set mag_hardware = QMC5883
set align_mag = CW270FLIP

# --- 3. MOTOR & SERVO MIXER (S1=Motor, S2=Left Elevon, S3=Right Elevon, S4=Canard) ---
mmix reset
mmix 0 1.000 0.000 0.000 0.000

smix reset
# S2 (Servo 1) = Left Wing Elevon (Roll + Pitch)
smix 0 1 0 100 0
smix 1 1 1 100 0
# S3 (Servo 2) = Right Wing Elevon (Roll + Pitch)
smix 2 2 0 100 0
smix 3 2 1 -100 0
# S4 (Servo 3) = Front Canard (Pitch Only — moves opposite rear elevons)
smix 4 3 1 -100 0

# --- 4. VTX SMARTAUDIO, BUNGEE AUTOLAUNCH & FAILSAFE RTH ---
set vtx_band = 5
set vtx_channel = 1
set vtx_power = 4
set nav_fw_launch_velocity = 300
set nav_fw_launch_accel = 1863
set nav_fw_launch_max_angle = 45
set nav_fw_launch_motor_delay = 500
set nav_fw_launch_spinup_time = 100
set nav_fw_launch_min_time = 0
set nav_fw_launch_timeout = 5000
set nav_fw_launch_max_altitude = 5000
set nav_fw_launch_climb_angle = 18
set nav_fw_launch_thr = 1700
set nav_fw_launch_idle_thr = 1000
set failsafe_procedure = RTH

save
